              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What is a prima donna literally? (First lady.) What is prima facie? (At first face.) What is a prima to you now? (A cousin.)"
